<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41622" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιχείρ-ησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>an attempt upon, attack,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.11
			</span></i>(pl.), <i><span class="en">
				4.130
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἐ. τινος ἐπί τινας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Act.Ap.</u>
					12.1
				</span></i>
			 cod. D ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἐ. μὴ
			συντάχυνε</span> the <i>attempt,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.71
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκφέρειν τὴν ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					8.132
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ποιεῖσθαί τινος</span>
			<i>attempt</i> a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.70
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ὑμετέρα ἐ.</span> the
				<i>attempt</i> upon you, ib.<i><span class="en">
				33
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἐ. τοῦ σῶσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					1.115b
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lg.</u>
				631a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>dialectical reasoning</i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιχείρημα</span> II), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Top.</u>
				111b16
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἐ. ποιεῖσθαι κατὰ τὸν εἰκότα
					λόγον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					12.7.4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Sign.</u>
				29
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Amm.</u>
				1.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.698a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>P.</u>
				2.192
			</span></i> (pl.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐφ᾽ ἑκάτερα τὴν ἐ.
				δεχόμενα</span> things capable of proof or disproof, <i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Prog.</u>
				5
			</span></i>.</div>
